  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Supernova:</strong> You can go supernova. While <em>Unleashed</em>, <strong>spend any number of Echos</strong> to make an attack roll against all targets within Far range. Targets you succeed against take <strong>1d20</strong> energy damage for each Echo spent. After going supernova you are no longer <em>Unleashed</em> and become Burned Out until the next rest. While Burned Out, you are <em>Vulnerable</em> and cannot become <em>Unleashed</em>.</p>",
